     ],
     "comparison": "Accepts an S2 permanent limit of 8% (above the acceptable ≤5% and above the ≤7% interim) that benefits Northwind, while pressing to keep S5 recall discretionary instead of a mandatory numeric recall at 8 per 100,000, which benefits Halcyon — a cross-section trade outside the acceptable ranges.",
