     "comparison": "Accepts the weakened S5 (no mandatory numeric recall at 8 per 100,000 — regulator investigation and corrective action instead) in order to secure mutual signatures, keeping Northwind’s weakened S2 (8% permanent cap) in place; both sections fall outside the acceptable ranges.",
